---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';

const sectors = [
  {
    title: 'Government',
    desc: 'Building AI into public systems, frontline decision-making and workforce capability, within real policy, data and operational constraints.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Nonprofits',
    desc: 'Connecting programme evidence, partner knowledge and workflows to strengthen strategy, programme operations and delivery.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Philanthropy',
    desc: 'Using portfolio evidence and shared infrastructure to strengthen investment decisions, grantee capability and responsible adoption.',
  },
];
---

<Base
  title="Purpose & Direction | Mission and Vision | APLYD"
  description="APLYD's mission and vision: helping institutions make better decisions at scale, toward intelligence embedded across public institutions."
  keywords="APLYD Purpose, AI Mission, Public Sector AI Vision, Institutional AI Capability"
>
  <div class="pt-20 sm:pt-24 lg:pt-28">
    {/* ============================ HERO ============================ */}
    <section class="bg-institutional-grid text-white py-16 sm:py-24 lg:py-28 relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10">
      <div class="container-x relative z-10">
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill bg-white/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-eyebrow font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/15">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-gold"></span>
          About APLYD · Purpose & Direction
        </div>

        <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-display font-light text-white leading-[1.05] text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
          Why we exist, and where we're headed
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-pale-navy/90 leading-relaxed">
          Two statements sit behind everything we do. The first is our purpose today. The second is the future that work is building toward.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ============================ SECTION 1: OUR MISSION ============================ */}
    <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white border-b border-hair">
      <div class="container-x space-y-12">
        <div class="max-w-4xl space-y-4">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gold">Purpose</div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-light text-navy leading-tight">
            Our mission
          </h2>
        </div>

        {/* Mission Statement Block */}
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-hair bg-paper/60 p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16 space-y-6">
          <blockquote class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light text-navy leading-snug">
            “To help institutions build the systems, capabilities, and intelligence to make better decisions at scale.”
          </blockquote>
          <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-mid-navy leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-4xl pt-2">
            The challenge in public-sector AI is not only developing the technology. It is creating the conditions for institutions to adopt, operate and improve it. We work across that journey, from identifying the decisions and services where AI can add value, to understanding delivery realities, building systems that fit institutional workflows, and measuring what changes in practice.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* 3 Sector Focus Cards */}
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          {sectors.map((sector) => (
            <div class="rounded-3xl border border-hair bg-white p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-sm space-y-4">
              <h3 class="text-2xl font-light text-navy">
                {sector.title}
              </h3>
              <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-mid-navy leading-relaxed font-normal">
                {sector.desc}
              </p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ============================ SECTION 2: OUR VISION ============================ */}
    <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white border-b border-hair">
      <div class="container-x">
        <div class="rounded-3xl gradient-navy gradient-sheen p-8 sm:p-14 lg:p-16 text-white relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
          <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl space-y-8">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill bg-white/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-eyebrow font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/15">
              <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-gold"></span>
              Vision
            </div>
            
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-light tracking-tight text-white">
              Our vision
            </h2>

            <div class="border-l-2 border-gold pl-6 sm:pl-8">
              <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light text-white leading-snug">
                Intelligence embedded across public institutions, enabling faster, fairer, and more informed decisions.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-6 text-lg sm:text-xl font-light text-pale-navy leading-relaxed max-w-3xl pt-2">
              <p>
                The measure of progress is not the number of pilots launched, but whether systems can be adopted, sustained and improved within the institutions they are designed to serve. That means building for continuity across changes in staff, resources and operating conditions, with the governance and evidence required to support long-term use.
              </p>
              <p class="pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
                A system that depends indefinitely on an external vendor does not create durable institutional capability. We build toward institutions that can operate, govern and improve their own AI systems, with ownership and capability developed from the outset.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ============================ CTA ============================ */}
    <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-paper">
      <div class="container-x">
        <div class="rounded-3xl border border-hair bg-white p-8 sm:p-14 shadow-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-8">
          <div class="max-w-2xl">
            <div class="text-xs uppercase font-bold tracking-widest text-gold mb-2">Next in About APLYD</div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-light text-navy mb-3">
              See our approach
            </h3>
            <p class="text-base text-mid-navy leading-relaxed">
              Discover how we organise our work from strategy and direction through design, delivery, and independent assurance.
            </p>
          </div>
          <Button href="/services/our-approach" variant="primary" class="whitespace-nowrap">
            See our approach &rarr;
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
